nce ----\nSummon models\nChange the texture of walls, etc.\nVisit other users' rooms\nCheck your own data\nLog in\nSwitch windows\nChange weather\nChange background music\nSave Room\nLoad Room\nVolume control\nChange language\n\n---Controls ----\nMove with the left controller stick.\nRotate with the right controller stick.\nThe upper trigger on the right controller controls the menu panel.\n\n When you open the menu panel of a model and select a model: \n You can summon & hold the model with the upper trigger on the right controller.\n Press A on the right controller to zoom in and out.\n Press B on the right controller to rotate the model.\n Delete a model with the lower trigger of the right controller.\n When you move the model while holding the model, the model will move.\n\n(More detailed explanation can be found at \"https://xrsns.org/\")\n\n---Special thanks---\nBGM: (C) K.Y., (C) L-side, (C) Sound Effect Lab\nModel: (C) MASAYOSHI, (C) Dimensiva, (C) 3D Shaker\nImage: (C) Pixabay", "short_description": "XR Designer is a VR game that allows you to design and share rooms.\nYou can visit rooms created by others, or upload your own models and wallpapers for use."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "278878251499070", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "XR Designer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "XR Designer\u3068\u306f\u90e8\u5c4b\u3092\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u3057\u305f\u308a\u5171\u6709\u3057\u3066\u904a\u3076\u3053\u3068\u306e\u3067\u304d\u308bVR\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\n\u4ed6\u306e\u4eba\u304c\u4f5c\u3063\u305f\u90e8\u5c4b\u306b\u904a\u3073\u306b\u884c\u304f\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u4f5c\u3063\u305f\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u3084\u58c1\u7d19\u3092\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3057\u3066\u4f7f\u7528\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n---\u6a5f\u80fd\u4e00\u89a7---\n\u30e2\u30c7\u30eb\u53ec\u559a\n\u